  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "İki sorun: bilinmeyen özne `KeyError` veriyor ve sıra abece değil.",
      "en": "Two problems: an unknown subject raises `KeyError` and the order is not alphabetical."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`matrix.get(subject, {})` ve sonda `return sorted(caps)`.",
      "en": "`matrix.get(subject, {})` and `return sorted(caps)` at the end."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef capability_list(matrix, subject):\n    caps = []\n    for obj, actions in matrix.get(subject, {}).items():\n        for action in actions:\n            caps.append(f\"{obj}:{action}\")\n    return sorted(caps)\n\nmatrix = {\n    \"ada\": {\"grades\": [\"write\", \"read\"]},\n    \"alan\": {\"grades\": [\"read\"], \"payroll\": [\"read\"]},\n}\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"alan\"))\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"ada\"))\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"nobody\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef capability_list(matrix, subject):\n    caps = []\n    for obj, actions in matrix.get(subject, {}).items():\n        for action in actions:\n            caps.append(f\"{obj}:{action}\")\n    return sorted(caps)\n\nmatrix = {\n    \"ada\": {\"grades\": [\"write\", \"read\"]},\n    \"alan\": {\"grades\": [\"read\"], \"payroll\": [\"read\"]},\n}\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"alan\"))\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"ada\"))\nprint(capability_list(matrix, \"nobody\"))\n```"
    }
  ],
